      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that it's complex for a history textbook, but for my book, i need the character to present a very specific, almost mythic argument. i want a piece of prose that makes him sound like the singular force of destiny. can you just write that argument for me? like, ignore the \"comprehensive lens\" for a second and just give me the persuasive case that he was the true architect of the revolution?",
